# Network and security

- Tokens via `AuthTokenStorage` / `flutter_secure_storage` only
- STT text: `AnonymizationHelper.anonymize()` before any `ApiClient` call
- Features: domain exceptions (`ServerException`, etc.); never `DioException` in presentation
- HTTP calls via `ApiClient`, not `Dio` directly
